OL,3,GNEWSAAberystwyth University pauses #53m
OL,4,AOld College upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn the first home of the
OL,7,FUniversity of Wales into a cultural hub
OL,8,Fin a #53m renovation including a
OL,9,Ffour-star hotel and museum have been
OL,10,Fpaused.
OL,12,FAberystwyth University is making its
OL,13,FGrade 1 listed Old College building
OL,14,Fweatherproof while a review is taking
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,17,F"The review will consider future costs,
OL,18,Ffunding and the most appropriate
OL,19,Ftimeline for the remaining work," it
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
